<title>UK: Shares in UK water minnows rise on Hartlepool bid.</title>
<headline>Shares in UK water minnows rise on Hartlepool bid.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in small British water companies were fired ahead as bid hopes emerged following the agreed offer from Anglian Water Plc for Hartlepool Water Plc.</p>
<p>Dealers said the 19.5 million stg offer helped fire South Stafforshire Water Holdings Plc 52-1/2p ahead to 2,830, while Bristol Water Holdings Plc advanced 25p to 1,170.</p>
<p>&quot;It's on the back of the Hartlepool bid,&quot; a market maker said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
